{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jOVa0r5zPL1793716839.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>德國答應向烏克蘭提供更多援助。</p><p></p><p>烏克蘭總統澤連斯基到德國訪問，德國總理默茨為他舉行歡迎儀式。默茨答應向烏克蘭提供更多援助，以及更多能源，協助烏方度過冬季。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.GER.UKR-2300-1_CLEAN_20261103_223207_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026J3VzOLmbUm1793716823.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>默茨又指，俄羅斯在黑海地區發動襲擊，會令局勢升溫，亦令全球陷入糧食短缺的危機，損害最貧窮的國家和地區。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:19.463938+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:18:20.241405+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:59:17.659285+00:00","content_hash":"1ea56a412a5b23ef587a02547ae76659d695a53b4223be796536992e868726fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:19.463938+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}